  {"date": "2000-06-22", "venue": "AmSouth Amphitheatre", "city": "Antioch", "state": "TN", "gap": 4, "set": "2", "jamchart": true, "jam": "An interesting jam which takes a more reserved, melodic route with Fish playing unaccompanied for a time as the band comes down to near silence briefly.  The latter part of the jam includes some effects from Page and a nice ascending progression.", "out": ">", "prev": "Also Sprach Zarathustra", "in": ">", "next": "Harry Hood", "nb": 1},
